{
  "uid": "pci-demo",
  "title": "PCI Sanitizer · Vorher & Nachher",
  "tags": [
    "PCI",
    "Demo",
    "OpenTelemetry"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "① Zahlung starten",
      "url": "http://localhost:8000/demo/payment",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "play",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "② Leak testen",
      "url": "http://localhost:8000/demo/payment-leak",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "bolt",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "run_id",
        "label": "Durchlauf (Run-ID oder .*)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "PCI TELEMETRY LAB",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Gleiche Zahlung. Zwei Wege. Sichtbarer Unterschied.\nSynthetische Zahlungsdaten → **RAW: unverändert** · **PCI-Sanitizer: Allowlist → Inhaltsprüfung → Verwerfen**\n\nOben **① Zahlung starten** oder **② Leak testen** wählen. Nach wenigen Sekunden erscheinen die Ergebnisse dieses Durchlaufs."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "🔴 OHNE SANITIZER",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Alles wird weitergegeben\nDer Raw-Collector transportiert auch die synthetische Kartennummer. Öffne unten den Raw-Trace und prüfe `process-payment` bzw. `process-payment-leak`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "🟢 MIT PCI-SANITIZER",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Betriebsdaten bleiben. Erkannte Kartendaten nicht.\n**Zahlung:** PAN-Attribut entfernt, sichere Felder erhalten.\n\n**Leak:** Der Payment-Span wird verworfen. Der sichere Demo-Rahmen bleibt zum Öffnen des Traces erhalten."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Sanitizer erreichbar · 1 = online",
      "description": "Prometheus prüft den Collector alle fünf Sekunden.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"pci-sanitizer-collector\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "noValue": "Noch keine Daten",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 46,
          "titleSize": 14
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Spans empfangen · seit Collector-Start",
      "description": "Alle vom Sanitizer empfangenen Spans, inklusive sicherer Demo-Rahmen. Nicht auf die Run-ID eingeschränkt.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans{job=\"pci-sanitizer-collector\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          },
          "noValue": "Noch keine Daten",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 46,
          "titleSize": 14
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Spans verworfen · seit Collector-Start",
      "description": "Echter Filter-Zähler des Sanitizers. Aggregiert über alle Durchläufe; kein Beweis für einen einzelnen Run. Fehlende Daten werden nicht als null dargestellt.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(otelcol_processor_filter_spans_filtered{job=\"pci-sanitizer-collector\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          },
          "noValue": "Noch keine Daten",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 46,
          "titleSize": 14
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "RAW · Payment-Attribute",
      "description": "Live-Daten aus Tempo. Eine leere Tabelle allein beweist keine Verwerfung. Nach dem Auslösen einige Sekunden warten.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"pci-demo-payment-app-raw\" && span:name =~ \"process-payment.*\" && span.demo.run_id =~ \"${run_id:raw}\" } | select(span.demo.run_id, span.demo.scenario, span.payment.status, span.payment.attempt_id, span.payment.card.pan)",
          "tableType": "spans",
          "limit": 50,
          "spss": 10
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "md",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Start time",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          },
          "noValue": "—"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*payment.card.pan.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 145
              }
            ],
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^(time|Start time)$"
            }
          },
          {
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 165
              }
            ],
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^(spanID|Span ID)$"
            }
          },
          {
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 235
              }
            ],
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "payment.attempt_id"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "traceName": true,
              "service.name": true,
              "traceService": true,
              "Name": true,
              "Trace Service": true,
              "Trace Name": true,
              "Duration": true,
              "demo.run_id": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "Span ID": 5,
              "demo.scenario": 3,
              "time": 4,
              "payment.card.pan": 2,
              "payment.attempt_id": 1,
              "Start time": 4,
              "traceIdHidden": 6,
              "payment.status": 0,
              "spanID": 5
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
